Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:06.00,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Houjou Sophie...{EP60}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:09.27,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,What kind of voice do you sing with?{EP60}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.48,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Thank you for tuning in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:17.04,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,I'm Tokuda Nene,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:21.85,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,and I'm up this early to get a scoop on the movie star Hibiki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:24.78,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Now then, let's find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.17,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:34.72,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.37,0:00:48.33,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm going up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:56.21,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:01:02.18,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,G-Good morning, Acting Principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:06.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.43,0:01:08.86,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I moved into one of the condos a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:12.03,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Thanks for looking after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:13.58,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Houjou Sophie-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:14.63,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.36,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I've heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:18.82,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You mesmerise people with your cool concerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:21.69,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and you are a natural born super idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:30.30,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:37.60,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I really do like prodigies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.27,0:01:39.63,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Let me give you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.09,0:01:45.03,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's a Celeb Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.03,0:01:51.16,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This is a fruit that exceeds the powerful plum that your father has been working towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:54.02,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,They're easy for me to come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:56.06,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Please try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:57.62,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:03.78,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I only eat Red Flash right before a concert...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:07.58,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You're perfect when you're on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:10.12,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That's how you should always be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:20.63,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,The elevator has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.05,0:02:22.59,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's the residents?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.10,0:02:28.93,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We've arrived at the lobby, so move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:36.48,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,This is a huge scoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.65,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,And his partner was Sophie...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.37,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Would you like a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:54.42,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{hiya!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:36.69,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Cool Scandal☆ Thanks for tuning in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:46.07,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Woah there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:51.24,Default,DressingPArfait,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:52.93,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:57.16,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Why is Sophie...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:59.09,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,...with Shikyouin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:03.65,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,How bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:05.55,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:07.04,Default-Alt,MiniSophieBubble,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:08.41,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Our Sophie, who normally acts like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:09.97,Default-Alt,Sophie,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:09.97,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,has suddenly become like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:12.80,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It's obvious something is amiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:14.26,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,Sophie-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:16.68,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:18.73,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Good morning, my little birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:22.19,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Make sure you follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:23.37,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.37,0:05:25.38,Default,Group,0,0,0,,We'll follow you anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:26.16,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:26.64,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Wai{\fscx300}-{って}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:27.65,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:30.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Morning, Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:31.38,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:32.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:35.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're acting kind of different today...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:36.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:38.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Your cowlick is missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:40.08,Default,Doron,0,0,0,,You're missing the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:44.05,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Sophie-sama's probably acting like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:47.03,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,...because she's aiming for the upcoming Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.03,0:05:50.74,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,...and decided to put more effort into her everyday life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:52.55,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,She's full up on cool-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:54.84,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Houjou-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:59.23,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You shouldn't mislead people by suddenly showing up with that cool demeanour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:01.50,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Paprika Private Academy rule number 9{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:05.97,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Those who fear change shall not prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.23,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:12.17,Default,Grouip,0,0,0,,Wow, Sophie-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.05,0:06:15.62,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I wonder what got into Sophie-san...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:19.35,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Do you think she ate something like 100 Red Flash this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.35,0:06:20.70,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,If I may.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:23.86,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,I'm Tokuda Nene from Paprika Academy's Newspaper Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:26.12,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Sophie-san's transformation...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:28.74,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Are you interested in finding out the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:30.54,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:32.72,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,So you know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:35.89,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,They say that love changes people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:37.85,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Getting right to the point, I, Tokuda,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:42.69,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,got the low-down on Sophie's morning love life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:44.82,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Sophie's love life?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:48.34,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Listen and be amazed! This isn't for the feint of heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:52.37,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,While Hibiki-sama and Sophie were in the elevator, Hibiki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:55.82,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What did he do to Sophie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:57.35,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:07:00.04,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We're listening so spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:02.35,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,From up against a wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:04.24,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,he took her chin,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:06.75,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,and kissed her like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:09.35,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Back to your old tricks again, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:11.21,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,I have photographic evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:15.11,Default,5,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:15.96,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:17.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,They're totally flirting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:19.73,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Though, I'm not sure they actually kissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:22.89,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.89,0:07:27.46,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Tokuda Nene shall now head out and carefully observe their affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:30.39,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Now then, please excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:33.82,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,How immodest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:37.58,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Students must focus on studying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.58,0:07:39.53,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Students{\fscx300}-{\fscx100} No...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:42.64,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Idols are not allowed to fall in love!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:43.62,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Eh? A boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:45.25,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,There's no way-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:48.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wha'd she mean by the anteater and the hippopotamus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:51.39,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Geez, that was against the wall he took her chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:53.30,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Leona, why don't you show her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:53.96,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:55.87,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:56.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:59.26,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Against the wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.26,0:08:00.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Against the wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:02.25,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}He takes her chin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:03.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}He takes her chin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.35,0:08:08.35,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:11.37,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Guess we'll have to explain it another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:15.31,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,From against the wall he takes her chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:17.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That's not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:19.78,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,One rice ball, Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:21.50,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,One yakisoba roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:28.81,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,One egg-salad sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:31.25,Default,obaachan,0,0,0,,H-Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.52,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Sophie-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:35.46,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You two...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:36.67,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:39.55,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:41.64,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We're going to perform until we burn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:44.34,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Oh. Sure, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:46.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophie's in high spirits today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:51.52,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,And you girls shall experience a stimulation like you've never had before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:55.48,Default-Alt,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:57.97,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:59.45,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:03.35,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Andou, prepare the usual roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:05.89,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:10.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,PriPara Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.26,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:17.54,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Oh, Sophie, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:19.97,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You're shining brightly today-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:22.52,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Did something happen-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:23.18,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:24.20,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kumama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.25,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Where are you taking me-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.48,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,H-Hey! That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:28.14,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:32.35,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,What's going on-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:34.20,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:35.30,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:38.21,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What is the highest number of consecutive concerts anyone has done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:40.21,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,One moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:44.71,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The current record is five consecutive concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:45.58,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:47.20,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Then in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:49.46,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'd like to double it and do ten consecutive concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.29,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ten?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.75,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.75,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:55.20,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,If you actually do ten consecutive concerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:57.82,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,that will be an accomplishment that'll go down in PriPara history!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:09:58.72,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.97,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Since, after accomplishing that goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.53,0:10:06.18,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,it is my hope that we will rank up to Divine Idol and stand atop the world of PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:10.60,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:10.60,Default-Alt,Larelle,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:12.81,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:18.15,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Let me verify.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:20.85,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's not like you can become Divine Idols in a day-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:22.89,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,There's no way something so ridiculous would be approved anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:24.42,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,No helping it. Nothing you could have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:24.42,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's been okayed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:24.99,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It was?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:26.70,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Okayed-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:26.70,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,Okayed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:29.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I had Mega-niisan verify it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:32.85,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,and to honour your spirit to challenge and achieve such a difficult task,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.85,0:10:34.17,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,he okayed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.58,Default-Alt,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:40.09,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,By having ten successful concerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:44.80,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile will be Divine Idols by nightfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:48.15,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,D-Divine Idols, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:49.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,My heart's pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:50.77,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:53.86,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,There's no way you'll be able to do something like that-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:57.83,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We have a .002% chance of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:11:00.82,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I realise that it's a hopeless gamble,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:04.05,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,but it's a huge chance for SoLaMi Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.05,0:11:05.76,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's put everything into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:09.38,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So, when you're excited, you forget to end your sentence with "pri", huh-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:11.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh man...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.23,0:11:21.97,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:24.97,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.68,0:11:27.69,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:31.90,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's been decided that SoLaMi Smile will be using their latest coords to start off their consecutive concerts:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:33.72,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,their Parasol Series Coords!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:34.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:35.11,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Rainy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:35.88,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Cloudy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:37.31,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Parasol Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.07,0:11:38.92,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.91,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Your attention, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:52.03,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile is going to try to do ten consecutive songs with a rank up to Divine Idols hanging in the balance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.05,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,My little songbirds,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.05,0:11:57.33,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I'll be flying to the sun today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:12:01.05,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Make sure to hold on tight so you aren't shaken loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:03.51,Default,Fan2,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:06.42,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,You can do it, Sophie-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:07.47,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:08.93,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Are they serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:12.29,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Song one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.29,0:12:13.35,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,Round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:13:01.11,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:02.02,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Princess...{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:04.36,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Princess, where are you-kuma?!!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:08.36,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:10.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Flower garden in full bloom!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:11.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,For you!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:15.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Lovely Flower Cinderella!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:16.73,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.49,0:13:21.05,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:28.38,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:48.78,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Not bad. You must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:51.30,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We don't have time for a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:52.07,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:53.53,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Sure thing-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:53.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:55.76,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,We don't have time for a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:58.00,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,Let's dash to the next concert studio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.50,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:07.13,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan your My Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:08.71,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:10.42,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:12.34,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Whatever matches!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:14.89,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Fluffy Pompom Mixture Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:16.18,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:18.34,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Song two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.34,0:14:19.39,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,Round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:48.57,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Song three!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:49.59,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,Round three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:01.03,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Song four!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.03,0:15:02.14,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,Round four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:11.28,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pushuu~pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:11.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.76,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,See, I told you so-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:17.14,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You haven't even done half of them and you're already this tired-kuma
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:18.33,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Pushushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:21.25,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You just don't have the stamina, do you, little songbirds?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:23.46,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Guess I'll have to breathe some life back into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:24.72,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:36.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Have you been good...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:38.93,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,...my little cagebirds-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:40.43,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.89,0:15:43.10,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:45.56,Default,Fans,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:47.08,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We haven't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:49.69,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,...been that good...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:51.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,...either!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:15:59.91,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Pushuu-Pushushushushushu~~~~.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:05.00,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Even the effect of Sophie's electric kiss only brought you this far-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.87,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Pull it together, you two-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:07.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ca{\alpha&HFF&}pisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:08.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capi{\alpha&HFF&}sce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:09.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capis{\alpha&HFF&}ce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:09.84,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:15.55,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Sophie, I want you to do your best until the end-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.39,0:16:17.51,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:18.74,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:23.74,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:29.86,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:37.91,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I'm speechless!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.91,0:16:40.61,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Sophie-san has performed songs six, seven, and eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:44.60,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,And with this, she's completed their ninth concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:48.25,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You truly are a prodigy, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:51.87,Default-Alt,Fans,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:51.87,Default,Fans,0,0,0,,Cool! Cool! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:54.05,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.17,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Sorry for the interruption!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:59.21,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,You're rushing to your tenth song.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:01.04,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Does this mean, when you're done,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:04.74,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,you're going to announce your love for Hibiki-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.74,0:17:07.29,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Can I get a word on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:08.42,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:09.73,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I hate jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:11.06,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.06,0:17:12.97,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't need a scoop to make myself known.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:14.82,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll make the news myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:18.88,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Wow! So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:20.00,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,This is troublesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.86,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Has Tokuda once again jumped to conclusions?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:28.94,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Does this mean that it'll only be Sophie who'll become a Divine Idol-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:30.62,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:34.54,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Sophie...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:38.33,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Finally, here comes the attempt at their tenth consecutive concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:39.26,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,Round ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:41.41,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,This makes it your tenth song!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:41.41,Default-Alt,Fan1,0,0,0,,Last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:42.22,Default-Alt,Fan1,0,0,0,,The last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:49.14,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,My cute little songbirds, want to see the birth of a Divine Idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:51.10,Default-Alt,Chanko,0,0,0,,We do-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:51.10,Default,Rest,0,0,0,,We do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:53.27,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Then let's fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:55.73,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Fasten your seat belts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:58.07,Default-Alt,Fan3,0,0,0,,She's becoming a Divine Idol...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:07.08,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:09.25,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:11.71,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:21.42,Default-Alt,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:22.09,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It seems the Celeb Flash's effect has worn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.51,0:18:26.42,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I would have liked to have seen more, but there seems to be a time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:29.71,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Sophie has quit just before the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:31.81,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,She didn't complete their tenth song!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:39.71,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sophie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.15,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You shouldn't sit up yet-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.15,0:18:46.59,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I need to perform...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.59,0:18:48.46,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:51.02,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Your attempt at becoming Divine Idols was a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.02,0:18:53.71,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So make sure to get some rest, okay-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.39,0:18:55.71,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:58.69,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I need to thank everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:04.58,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I want to do the first song again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:12.23,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We may have failed our attempt at becoming Divine Idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:14.25,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,but for those who cheered for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.25,0:19:17.44,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,let's perform another concert for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:19.98,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,,Despite that, it was still awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:22.50,Default,Fan2,0,0,0,,It was exhausting just listening...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:23.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:24.99,Default,Fans,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.53,0:19:28.06,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:30.24,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's put everything into one last song-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.53,0:19:33.21,Default,Fans,0,0,0,,...yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:37.86,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll fill all these little songbirds with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.66,0:20:16.75,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,675)}Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:19.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,675)}Save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:21.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,675)}Someone save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.11,0:20:37.16,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,675)}Liberation Maiden Valkyria!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:39.35,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,675)}Beauty Venus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:43.38,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,675)}Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:50.53,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,675)}Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:08.12,Default-Alt,Fan1,0,0,0,,Sophie-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:09.55,Default-Alt,Fan2,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Sophie-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.55,0:21:11.55,Default-Alt,Fan3,0,0,0,,She is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:22.02,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Anyway, I got you to show me your hidden powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:26.91,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You are an idol worthy of winning the Idol GrandPrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:30.95,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Now then, the next one I'll go after...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.86,0:23:08.88,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It seems you're serious, Shikyouin Hibiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:09.98,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.98,0:23:10.88,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.52,0:23:13.34,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It seems this will be truly enjoyable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:14.93,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.93,0:23:16.62,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Shion vs Hibiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.62,0:23:17.91,Default,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.91,0:23:19.89,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
